{"text": "MEMORANDUM\n\nJuly 5, 1994\n\nJ. D. Heck\n\nA. P. Deaton\n\nSUBJECT: Monthly Summary Report of Activities in the Life\n\nSciences Section for June 1994 (PROJECTS H414 TP, B451\nCMP, B601, B496, B497, Q126)\n\n\u2018The following text is a summary of the activity of the Life\nSciences section during the month of June. For the most part,\nthis report is organized by study.\n\nTesting Program (H-414)\n\n1.\n\nAcute Oral Toxicity in Rats (IITRI)\n\nThe following reports were accepted as final: A328, A335,\nA336, A337.\n\nAcute Cardiovascular and Respiratory Study (HRC)\n\nA correction letter was written for the following draft\nfinal reports: B265, B274, B275, and B276.\n\nHepatic Enzyme Induction (Microbiological Associates)\n\n\u2018The following corrected final reports were received for\nreview: B145, B266, B267, B268, B270, B274, B275, and B276.\n\nImmunomodulatory Assay (IITRI)\n\nA correction letter was written for the following draft\nfinal report: B261.\n\nThe following draft final report was received for review:\nB262.\n\nInhalation Study with Transgenic Mouse (Hazleton Washington)\nReport on \u201cP-post labeling is past due.\n13-Week Inhalation Study with D040 (IITRI)\n\nA draft final report has been received and is being re-\nviewed.\n\nInhalation Study with D39, Immune Function (IITRI). A final\nreport for this special study was received and accepted.\n\nvencebeg", "words": [{"text": "MEMORANDUM", "x0": 314, "y0": 145, "x1": 428, "y1": 155, "conf": 95.0}, {"text": "July", "x0": 485, "y0": 172, "x1": 519, "y1": 184, "conf": 88.0}, {"text": "5,", "x0": 530, "y0": 172, "x1": 542, "y1": 183, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "1994", "x0": 556, "y0": 172, "x1": 588, "y1": 182, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "J.", "x0": 177, "y0": 204, "x1": 192, "y1": 213, "conf": 61.0}, {"text": "D.", "x0": 204, "y0": 204, "x1": 218, "y1": 213, "conf": 73.0}, {"text": "Heck", "x0": 230, "y0": 202, "x1": 264, "y1": 213, "conf": 96.0}, {"text": "A.", "x0": 177, "y0": 233, "x1": 192, "y1